{"id":"f0611b8a-6cd2-44c2-9498-2d3c85fcafce","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:25:45.561Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Eine Pyramide hat eine dreieckige Grundfläche. Die Grundseite des Dreiecks hat eine Länge von "},{"type":"math","src":"g = 7 \,\text{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" und die dazugehörige Höhe beträgt "},{"type":"math","src":"b = 3 \,\text{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":". Die Pyramide besitzt eine Höhe "},{"type":"math","src":"h = 12 \,\text{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":". Berechne das Volumen der Pyramide."}]}],"id":"c4a67209-701f-4ac7-86c6-3747694d153b"}],"id":"da3a3296-3bf2-427b-8a75-0bd83757b08e"},"interactive":{"plugin":"inputExercise","state":{"type":"input-string-normalized-match-challenge","unit":"cm³","answers":[{"value":"42 cm^3","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Richtig! Gut!"}]}],"id":"8816e44e-f0a4-467f-bb52-016d0ddc973c"}},{"value":"42 cm³","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Richtig! Gut!"}]}],"id":"387ebe27-e529-47d5-bf4d-c88a1c80c226"}},{"value":"42","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Richtig! Gut!"}]}],"id":"4242c507-2a3e-41c8-ae1f-304d7ef8c145"}}]},"id":"dc7aaff1-861e-4520-84f7-0147bff38269"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"prerequisite":{"id":"1629","title":"Pyramide"},"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"87e49ffc-9300-47b8-a4eb-1e800049cda1"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Das Volumen der "},{"type":"a","href":"1629","children":[{"text":"Pyramide"}]},{"text":" kannst du mit folgender Formel berechnen:"}]}],"id":"31e40a69-316f-4d08-969e-d0568a92c820"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"V_{\text{Pyramide}} = \dfrac{1}{3} \cdot G \cdot h","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"4e491c65-f2b0-4299-b3fc-8ee08cec8a22"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"G","em":true},{"text":" steht für die Grundfläche. Aus der Fragstellung weißt du, dass die Grundfläche ein "},{"type":"a","href":"1949","children":[{"text":"Dreieck"}]},{"text":" ist. Nun kannst du den Flächeninhalt der Grundfläche berechnen."}]}],"id":"2e1ab1d2-96e0-46c0-85c1-c6942bfd3915"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
G &=& A_{\text{Dreieck}} = \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot g \cdot b \\\\
G &=& \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot 7 \,\text{cm} \cdot 3 \,\text{cm} = 10,5 \,\text{cm}^2
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"d0504152-19f8-4ebc-b584-675e4575210c"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Um das Volumen zu berechnen, brauchst du jetzt nur noch die Höhe und den Grundwert in die Formel einzusetzen."}]}],"id":"6b35a5eb-f39c-4c5f-b35e-b3c239f814de"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
V_{\text{Pyramide}} &=& \dfrac{1}{3} \cdot G \cdot h \\\\
V_{\text{Pyramide}} &=& \dfrac{1}{3} \cdot 10,5 \,\text{cm}^2 \cdot 12\,\text{cm} = 42 \,\text{cm}^3
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"16f55646-88cf-47ec-91cc-fc3d32764300"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Daraus folgt, dass das Volumen der Pyramide "},{"type":"math","src":"42 \,\text{cm}^3","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" beträgt."}]}],"id":"bbe47450-70e3-4e51-80e4-0f968c819340"}],"id":"45bcab6c-5e66-41ca-9ebe-fae0eb7b71e5"}},"id":"e5650ba6-3122-47f1-a37f-f05dbb161c71"}},"id":"75e02e37-4612-41e5-982c-e395cc23f5d5"}}
